{"kind":"doc","route":"/learn-effect/","title":"Learn CraftTS with Effect","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"learn-craftts-with-effect","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Learn CraftTS with Effect"}]},{"t":"figure","src":"/craft/assets/effect-logo-black.png","alt":"Effect","variant":"effect-logo-lockup"},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is the guided path for teams that already use "},{"t":"link","href":"https://effect.website/","external":true,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and want CraftTS to own the UI, reactivity and application graph."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If you are evaluating CraftTS from an existing Effect codebase, start with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/00-start-here","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect users: start here"}]},{"t":"text","text":". It explains what stays"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"in Effect, what moves to Craft's UI model, and how to try the integration in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fifteen minutes."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You start with a Craft component, then move the domain work into Effect programs:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer"},{"t":"text","text":" provides services, "},{"t":"code","text":"Effect<A, E, R>"},{"t":"text","text":" carries success, typed failures and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requirements, and Craft adapters expose those programs as reactive resources."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-you-will-build","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What you will build"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Step"}],[{"t":"text","text":"What you add"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/00-start-here","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"0. Effect users: start here"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"boundary, quickstart and adapter choice"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/01-first-component","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"1. Start with a Craft component"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftComponent"},{"t":"text","text":", templates, native Craft state"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/02-derive","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"2. Derive UI state"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":", precise dependencies"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/03-effect-domain","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"3. Put the domain in Effect"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"Effect"},{"t":"text","text":", tagged errors, "},{"t":"code","text":"Context.Service"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"SyncOp"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/04-load-data","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"4. Load data with Effect"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"queryEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", typed errors and defects"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/05-write-data","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"5. Write data with Effect"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"mutationEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcessEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", reactive updates"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/06-layers-routing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"6. Provide Layers and route the app"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"app/route Layers, DI proofs, type-safe routes"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/07-forms-validation","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"7. Build forms and validate boundaries"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"Effect Schema, forms, typed submit errors"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/08-testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"8. Test the graph"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"Effect service mocks, Craft registers, architecture tests"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/09-server-functions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"9. Call server functions — POC"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"client/server boundary, "},{"t":"code","text":"serverFunction"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"executeEffect"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"before-you-start","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Before you start"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You need a TypeScript application, Node.js 20.19+ (or 22.12+), and basic"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"knowledge of generators. The guide uses Effect 4 RC and the beta CraftTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"packages:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/core@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/component@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/effect@beta","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"effect@rc","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"-D","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/core"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/component"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/effect"},{"t":"text","text":" on the same"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS version. "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/effect"},{"t":"text","text":" has "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"},{"t":"text","text":" as a peer dependency."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Experimental APIs","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS and this Effect integration are still experimental. The Effect bridge,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the server-function API and their types can change between beta releases. The"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server-function chapter is deliberately labelled "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"proof of concept"}]},{"t":"text","text":": use it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to explore the model, not as a final production contract."}]}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"The central rule","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft owns the reactive boundary. Effect owns domain programs and their"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dependencies. Do not create a "},{"t":"code","text":"stateEffect"},{"t":"text","text":": use native Craft "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" for UI"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state, and use "},{"t":"code","text":"queryEffect"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"mutationEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcessEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" when an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Effect program crosses into a Craft resource."}]}]},{"t":"row","layout":"end","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/01-first-component","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Start → Craft component"}]}]}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"what-you-will-build","text":"What you will build"},{"level":2,"id":"before-you-start","text":"Before you start"}]}